{"unit_id":"Noemm__dsh-web-search-glm#card-zh","repo":"Noemm/dsh-web-search-glm","commit":"d4003022b858f39e06f26f35f4eecfe4316c10ff","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-glm 是一个 DSH 搜索提供方插件，将智谱 GLM 的原生 web_search 接入 DSH 的 web seam。它向 Anthropic-compatible Messages API 发送查询，并把 GLM 返回的搜索结果映射为统一来源。它支持解析 Python repr 与 JSON 结果、合并多次搜索并按 URL 去重，也支持凭据引用、可配置模型和搜索次数上限。适合希望用智谱 GLM 为 DSH 增加联网资料检索的用户。使用时需要可用的 GLM API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-5","lib/index.js:45-87","lib/index.js:201-232","lib/parser.js:246-331"]}
{"unit_id":"Noemm__dsh-web-search-glm#card-en","repo":"Noemm/dsh-web-search-glm","commit":"d4003022b858f39e06f26f35f4eecfe4316c10ff","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-search-glm connects Zhipu GLM's native web search to DSH's web seam. It sends queries to the Messages API and normalizes returned sources, including Python repr and JSON payloads. Searches can be merged and deduplicated by URL. A GLM API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:3-5","lib/index.js:45-87","lib/index.js:201-232","lib/parser.js:246-331"]}
