{"unit_id":"Noemm__dsh-web-search-glm#feature-1","repo":"Noemm/dsh-web-search-glm","commit":"d4003022b858f39e06f26f35f4eecfe4316c10ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-glm 的功能「GLM 联网搜索」：把用户查询发送到 GLM Messages API，并启用原生 web_search 工具。每次请求可限制工具调用次数，返回搜索响应供 DSH 使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:49-87"]}
{"unit_id":"Noemm__dsh-web-search-glm#feature-2","repo":"Noemm/dsh-web-search-glm","commit":"d4003022b858f39e06f26f35f4eecfe4316c10ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-glm 的功能「结果标准化」：将 GLM 的 server_tool_use 与 tool_result 配对，把标题、链接和摘要整理成统一搜索来源，并按 URL 去重。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/parser.js:246-331"]}
{"unit_id":"Noemm__dsh-web-search-glm#feature-3","repo":"Noemm/dsh-web-search-glm","commit":"d4003022b858f39e06f26f35f4eecfe4316c10ff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-glm 的功能「凭据与端点配置」：每次搜索解析 API key，可从凭据服务或启动环境获取；baseURL 也能使用 GLM_SEARCH_BASE_URL 环境回退值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:118-130","lib/index.js:200-216"]}
